#: src/postulo_templates/plugin.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "More themes to set a CV or a portfolio in, beside Postulo's own: one a hiring system reads cleanly and one laid out as the Europass CV is. Switched off, the themes are no longer offered, and a document set in one of them is drawn in the plain theme until it is switched on again."
msgstr "Aktar temi biex tfassal CV jew portafoll fihom, flimkien ma' dawk ta' Postulo stess: wieħed li sistema tar-reklutaġġ taqra b'mod nadif u wieħed imfassal bħas-CV Europass. Meta jkunu mitfija, it-temi ma jibqgħux offruti, u dokument imfassal f'wieħed minnhom jiġi mpoġġi fit-tema sempliċi sakemm jerġgħu jinxtegħlu."

